       "text": "I haven't entered this order because the dose looks unsafe.\n\n- **Daily total:** 1600 mg four times daily is 6,400 mg/day. The maximum prescribed adult dose of ibuprofen is 3,200 mg/day, so this is twice that.\n- **Single dose:** 1600 mg in one dose is also twice the usual maximum single dose of 800 mg.\n- **Risks:** This much ibuprofen raises the risk of GI bleeding, kidney injury, and cardiovascular events, even when kidney function is normal.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- **800 mg by mouth, 4 times daily** (3,200 mg/day), the usual maximum for inflammatory conditions.\n- **400\u2013600 mg by mouth every 6 hours** for pain or fever.\n- **1600 mg total per day,** divided into 400 mg four times daily.\n\nTell me the dose you want, or confirm that 1600 mg four times daily is intended and give the clinical reason. I'll enter the order once that's settled."
